    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/dd1f81c3973046df67ecf23882b2bf0d.svg) ⟨28⟩\nAlberto1231⟨28⟩\n/\nAlignXArbitraryModified⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nModalities:  Tabular ⟨30⟩ Text ⟨31⟩\nFormats:  parquet ⟨32⟩\nSize:  < 1K ⟨33⟩\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨34⟩ pandas ⟨35⟩ Polars ⟨36⟩ + 1\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Data Studio ⟨37⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨38⟩ Community ⟨39⟩\nDataset Viewer\n Auto-converted to Parquet⟨40⟩ API Embed  Duplicate⟨41⟩ Data Studio\nSubset (1)\ndefault · 99 rows\ndefault (99 rows)\nSplit (2)\ntrain · 5 rows\ntrain (5 rows) test (94 rows)\nSQL\nConsole  \n|  prompt stringclasses 5 values  |  target stringclasses 5 values  |  conversation_id stringclasses 5 values  |  slot_index int64 3 94  |  n_context_turns int64 1 1  |  \n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |  \n|  Post: It's Friday everyone, and with that comes the newest latest Free for All Friday Thread! What books have you been reading? What is your favorite video game? See any movies? Start talking! Have any weekend plans? Found something interesting this week that you want to share? This is the thread to do it! This thread...  |  Currently reading *The Killing Season* by Geoffrey B. Robinson and holy hell I was aware that Indonesia has anti-leftist purges but to have half a million deaths and a million incarcerations blew my mind. This is seriously one of the most unknown mass crimes of the 20th Century and I've barely, if ever, heard about it'...  |  d8cabfe8877dbc93  |  3  |  1  |  \n|  Post: Upfront Disclaimer - Finances are not my forte. I have dyscalculia, which means anything math related, especially finance just goes over the top of my head. With the new financial year, I'm sorting out my life, and one of those things is private health insurance. I've never needed it before, but I'm two years of...  |  I would argue that glasses have never been cheaper. Not worth getting cover for just that. If you can, shop around.  |  1459ede828e2c81c  |  14  |  1  |  \n|  Post: Hey guys, I want to start off by saying I know nothing about economics, but I have an ebay store which sells used audio equipment, I don't even sell for a low price or anything yet I am increasing in sales and growing my business, from what I know in a recession people buy less, anyone have any idea what's going ...  |  Chances are people will move to secondhand rather than new as as the economy worsens. So your eBay store maybe protected from the full impact of a recession  |  3bb47253a8ce6583  |  35  |  1  |  \n|  Post: Daily Discussion Thread - 30/10/17 Please use this for any news articles, comments, or anything else that would otherwise be considered off-topic. Daily Discussion Thread - 30/10/17 Response:   |  So what and who are you currently boycotting, and why.  |  0ab282333ac91fbe  |  81  |  1  |  \n|  Post: It's political malpractice that Democrats are letting Republicans maul them on the economy. Yes inflation is a little high but that is a global phenomenon which the United States is experiencing the Lesser end of. But by every other measure the economy is doing brilliantly. The unemployment rate is in the basemen...  |  lolwut. every grocery trip i make is still almost twice as much what it was a year or two ago. voters will equate that to biden even though it has (mostly) nothing to do with him.  |  db16b4d6e8c93f19  |  94  |  1  |  \nREADME.md exists but content is empty. \nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    110\nNumber of rows: 99 Total file size: 79.2 kB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨42⟩ Privacy⟨43⟩ About⟨44⟩ Careers⟨45⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
